{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6 Ukrainian Modification of the ED4M Electric Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This add-on brings a highly detailed model of the ED4M electric train, adapted for operation on the Ukrainian railway network, into the simulator. With a realistic 3D model, accurate textures, and a faithfully recreated interior and driver's cab, this DLC aims to replicate the real-life experience of operating this iconic suburban train.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfed History &amp; Production</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ED4M is a modernized direct current electric multiple unit (EMU), developed by the Demikhovo Engineering Plant (Russia) based on the earlier ER2 and ED2T series. Production began in 1996.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features of the ED4M series:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated driver\u2019s cab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improved ventilation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reconfigured passenger saloons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Ukraine, some ED4M trainsets were transferred after the collapse of the USSR or later purchased by Ukrzaliznytsia. A number of units underwent local modernization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2699\ufe0f Technical Specifications</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Current system:</strong> DC, 3 kV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Track gauge:</strong> 1520 mm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Train length:</strong> 4 to 12 cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maximum speed:</strong> 130 km/h</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power output:</strong> up to 4000 kW</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Traction type:</strong> motorized head and trailer cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seating per car:</strong> 110\u2013140</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6 Ukrainian Specification</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characteristic liveries used by Ukrainian Railways (blue-yellow, dark blue, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locally upgraded interiors, control panels, and saloons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Signaling and announcements remain in Russian, consistent with original equipment</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae DLC Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic 3D model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed animated driver's cab (controller, reverser, brake handles, gauges)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom sounds for traction motors, compressor, and relay equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatible with Ukrainian routes in ZDSimulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes real train numbers from units operated in Ukraine</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1 Regional Use</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This add-on is intended for use on routes electrified with 3 kV DC.</strong> Suitable regions in Ukraine include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kharkiv region</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parts of the Dnipro region</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lviv region</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Western Ukraine, including lines toward the borders with Poland and Slovakia</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614850?t=1744917884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614850/dd19a788d45ecb82e5eae4320ec3e0e884e0fd0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744917884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614850/5eea0a0a9e67a995b3884d96d2b4c3b71e0efd18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614850/5eea0a0a9e67a995b3884d96d2b4c3b71e0efd18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917884","